│   │   └── api/        # Axios Client
│   └── package.json
│
├── database/           # SQLite schema & seed files
└── docs/               # Architecture diagrams & documentation
🚀 Use Cases
🧳 Smart Travel Planner: "Plan my 3-day Goa trip under ₹15,000, and analyze this beach photo."

📚 Study Assistant: "Explain photosynthesis, remember my weak topics, and quiz me."

🖼️ Image Q&A: "What's in this chart? Summarize the trends."

🎯 Scope & Constraints (Practice Project)
This project is built as a practice-grade, enterprise-inspired architecture, not a production SaaS.
Explicitly NOT included:

Authentication / Authorization

Payment gateways

Custom model training

The focus is on architectural clarity, cognitive system design, and clean code.

