Bhai, ye lo naya README.md file ka pura content. Tune jo project banaya hai (synapse-mind), uske hisaab se maine ise ekdum professional aur attractive tarike se likha hai.

Kya karna hai?
Apne project folder me ek nayi file banao jiska naam README.md rakho, aur ye pura code usme copy-paste kar do. Ye GitHub pe tera project bahot premium aur impressive dikhayega. Interviewer isko padh ke hi impress ho jayega! 😎

