🧳 Smart Travel Planner: "Plan my 3-day Goa trip under ₹15,000, and analyze this beach photo."

📚 Study Assistant: "Explain photosynthesis, remember my weak topics, and quiz me."

🖼️ Image Q&A: "What's in this chart? Summarize the trends."

