### 🚀 Aage kya?
Ab tu is README ko GitHub pe push kar de. Ye ab bahot hi professional aur complete lag raha hai. 

Iske baad humein **actual project files** banani hain. Bata, ab main tujhe **Backend ka pura folder structure aur files** banana shuru karu? (Mera suggestion: Backend pehle, phir Frontend).
giginore file
Bhai, .gitignore file bahut important hoti hai. Ye Git ko batati hai ki kaunsi files GitHub pe upload nahi karni hain (jaise ki tera .env file jisme API key hai, ya venv folder, ya node_modules). Agar tu isko nahi banayega, toh tera API key leak ho jayega aur repo bahut bhari (heavy) ho jayega.

Apne project ke main folder (root) me ek nayi file banao jiska naam rakho .gitignore (shuru me dot hai, uske baad gitignore). Aur ye pura content usme copy-paste kar de:

